ReasonforDeviation_Summary:
The deviation of 1 267 209 mandays to the value of Rb1,052 was incurred as a result of the increased utilisation of Reserve Forces to augment HR capacity constraints to:
•	support current military operations;
•	meet administrative compliance obligations of the DOD;
•	provide protection services (guards).

To enable the MOD&MV to engage Cabinet and Parliament on a stable resourced Future Defence Policy Concept (Level of Defence Ambition), the Future Defence Strategic Direction was presented to:
•	President on 24 Jan 2024;  
•	PCDMV on 05 Mar 2024; 
•	JSCD on 07 Mar 2024; 
•	JCPS Cluster Development Committee on 26 Mar 2024.

The JCPS DGs were subsequently briefed on 09 Apr 2024.
